---
layout: post
---
{{ content }}

{% comment %}
  Provenance note for republished archive material. The text comes from
  `archive_note`, set per collection under `defaults` in _config.yml, so each
  archive explains its own origin and this layout stays generic.
{% endcomment %}

{% if page.archive_note %}
  <hr>

  <p class="post-meta">
    {{ page.archive_note }}
    {% if page.author contains '2950v' %}
      The <em>{{ page.author }}</em> byline is group authorship for the students in
      that year's class, used so that no student is individually identifiable.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
{% endif %}
